{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a prey or predator, a world where magic moves you through the islands of void. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the Finish ORB, then when magic is disabled;  find the exit lamp to move you to the next island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3d platformer of a small inhabitant of the void island, who is able to transcend to other floating void islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemies and complete the levels as a passifist animal, but other void creatures are not the same and may attack or defend </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Void slands to explore, C++ Beach Engine 2.0 (2025). Developed by hojiin studios.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN SETTINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It should work out the box, remember to disable connections that are not connected to the local network if you want the best experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Found first enemy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/480e613e6f7e935edf51c50553edfcb52d0b3599.jpg"},{"name":"Completed first world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/b20d7eaebf31f05d28b23d519b78565d26616d19.jpg"},{"name":"Jumped through 30 portals","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/fc3a66db125b1481708e22797792ed3536a94903.jpg"},{"name":"Entered last world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/f86d5104becb4eb51e5805ec757a09168252dc47.jpg"},{"name":"Entered new world","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2821250/f86d5104becb4eb51e5805ec757a09168252dc47.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2821250?t=1768313919","backg